    ("h2", "uygunluk", "3. Eligibility and Your Account"),
    ("p", "You must be **at least 18 years old** to use the App. When creating an account you agree to provide accurate information, keep your password confidential and be responsible for activity under your account. Each person may only create an account for themselves. If you notice unauthorized use, notify us at [[email]]."),
    ("h2", "tibbi-sorumluluk-reddi", "4. Medical Disclaimer"),
    ("hl", "PulseCoach is **not** a medical device, a diagnostic tool or a healthcare provider and must not be used for these purposes. The AI coach's workout, nutrition and lifestyle recommendations are for general information only and do **not** replace the advice, diagnosis or treatment of a physician, dietitian, physical therapist or psychologist. The calorie suggestion is an estimate based on a general formula. Before starting an exercise or nutrition program, consult your physician, especially if you have an existing condition, injury, pregnancy, a history of eating disorders or a chronic illness. If you feel unwell, have thoughts of harming yourself or are in an emergency, call your local emergency number (**112** in Turkey) immediately or go to the nearest medical facility. Whether you follow the recommendations is your decision."),
