    ("h2", "garanti-reddi", "9. Service Limitations, Duration and Disclaimer"),
    ("p", "PulseCoach is a project run by an individual developer and may be offered for a limited time. The App is provided \"as is\" and \"as available\"; we do not guarantee that it will be uninterrupted or error-free or that AI outputs will always be accurate. The App may occasionally be unavailable due to maintenance or technical issues. If we discontinue the service entirely, we will announce it **at least 30 days in advance** in the app and to your registered email address, give you time to download your data, and delete all personal data at the end of that period."),
