    ("p", "To the extent permitted by applicable law, we are not liable for indirect damages arising from your use of or inability to use the App. This limitation does not exclude liability for intent or gross negligence, for unlawful processing of personal data or in cases where liability cannot be limited by law, and it does not affect your statutory rights as a consumer."),
